+| Метод | Путь | Запрос → ответ |
+|---|---|---|
+| GET | `/health` | `{"status":"ok"}` |
+| POST | `/generate` | `{repo, last, toxic, deepseek_key, github_token}` → `{digest, commits, source, tone}` |
